{"meta":{"id":"speedtest-cli","category":"it/server/infra/load-test","title":"네트워크 속도 측정 (speedtest-cli)","subtitle":"","summary":"speedtest-cli 로 PC · 노트북 회선의 다운로드 · 업로드 속도와 지연 시간 측정","tags":["speedtest","speedtest-cli","네트워크","속도","python"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"test_setting","updatedAt":"2025-02-13"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>NETWORK</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-02-13</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">네트워크 속도 측정 (speedtest-cli)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> speedtest-cli 로 PC · 노트북 회선의 다운로드 · 업로드 속도와 지연 시간 측정</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">개요</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong>speedtest-cli</strong> 는 Speedtest.net 서버와 통신해 다운로드 · 업로드 속도와 지연 시간(ping)을 터미널에서 측정하는 Python 도구입니다. 서버로 쓰는 노트북의 회선 속도를 확인하려고 측정했습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">설치와 실행</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">pip install speedtest-cli\r\n\r\n# 상세 출력 (가까운 측정 서버 자동 선택)\r\nspeedtest-cli\r\n\r\n# 결과만 간단히 (Ping / Download / Upload)\r\nspeedtest-cli --simple</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">측정 결과 (2025-02-13)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">장비</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">측정 서버 · 거리</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">지연</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">다운로드</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">업로드</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">PC (1Gbps 회선)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MOACK Data Center (Yongin-si) · 70.77 km</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">11.347 ms</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">692.51 Mbit/s</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">537.61 Mbit/s</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">노트북 (100Mbps)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MOACK Data Center (Yongin-si) · 70.77 km</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">29.087 ms</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">94.03 Mbit/s</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">94.13 Mbit/s</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">노트북은 100Mbps 랜 기준으로 거의 최대 속도가 나왔고, 1Gbps 회선의 PC 는 약 7배 빠른 결과였습니다. 서버 트래픽 한계를 볼 때는 노트북 회선(약 94Mbit/s)이 상한이 됩니다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/load-test/speedtest-cli","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"load-test","title":"부하 · 속도 측정","path":"it/server/infra/load-test"}],"hasImage":false}